{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 0, "result": {"protocolVersion": "2025-06-18", "capabilities": {"tools": {"listChanged": false}, "resources": {}, "prompts": {}}, "serverInfo": {"name": "ucas", "title": "ucas, a computer algebra system for programmers", "version": "1"}, "instructions": "ucas analyses functions (exhaustively on machine types), does exact algebra and calculus, transforms, number theory and finite fields, and finds cheaper implementations, each answer checked or proved.  Expressions are ucas syntax strings; give parameters types (x: u8, x: f32, x: real) where it matters.  Definitions persist across calls.  An ambiguous input is an error listing its readings: retry with args.assume.KEY.  structuredContent holds the typed result, checks and proof."}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "y'' + 2*y' + 5*y = 0, y(0) = 1, y'(0) = 0\n  transformed: (s^2 + 2s + 5)Y(s) - (s + 2) = 0\n  Y(s) = (s + 2)/(s^2 + 2s + 5)\n  y(t) = e^(-t)*(cos(2t) + sin(2t)/2)    for t >= 0\n  poles of Y: -1 +- 2i\n  check: residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 8.9e-16; initial values hold (max difference 0)\n  check: a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 1.7e-13\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "laplace_solve", "ucas": "laplace solve y'' + 2*y' + 5*y = 0, y(0)=1, y'(0)=0", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "laplace_solve", "transformed": "(s^2 + 2s + 5)Y(s) - (s + 2) = 0", "Y(s)": "(s + 2)/(s^2 + 2s + 5)", "y(t)": {"value": "e^(-t)*(cos(2t) + sin(2t)/2)", "valid_for": "t >= 0"}, "poles_of_y": "-1 +- 2i", "headline": "y'' + 2*y' + 5*y = 0, y(0) = 1, y'(0) = 0"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 8.9e-16; initial values hold (max difference 0)"}, {"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 1.7e-13"}], "files": [], "text": "y'' + 2*y' + 5*y = 0, y(0) = 1, y'(0) = 0\n  transformed: (s^2 + 2s + 5)Y(s) - (s + 2) = 0\n  Y(s) = (s + 2)/(s^2 + 2s + 5)\n  y(t) = e^(-t)*(cos(2t) + sin(2t)/2)    for t >= 0\n  poles of Y: -1 +- 2i\n  check: residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 8.9e-16; initial values hold (max difference 0)\n  check: a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 1.7e-13\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "y'' + y = cos(t), y(0) = 0, y'(0) = 0\n  transformed: (s^2 + 1)Y(s) = s/(s^2 + 1)\n  Y(s) = s/(s^2 + 1)^2\n  y(t) = t*sin(t)/2    for t >= 0\n  poles of Y: +-i (double)\n  check: residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 8.3e-16; initial values hold (max difference 0)\n  check: a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 2.3e-13\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "laplace_solve", "ucas": "laplace solve y'' + y = cos(t), y(0)=0, y'(0)=0", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "laplace_solve", "transformed": "(s^2 + 1)Y(s) = s/(s^2 + 1)", "Y(s)": "s/(s^2 + 1)^2", "y(t)": {"value": "t*sin(t)/2", "valid_for": "t >= 0"}, "poles_of_y": "+-i (double)", "headline": "y'' + y = cos(t), y(0) = 0, y'(0) = 0"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 8.3e-16; initial values hold (max difference 0)"}, {"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 2.3e-13"}], "files": [], "text": "y'' + y = cos(t), y(0) = 0, y'(0) = 0\n  transformed: (s^2 + 1)Y(s) = s/(s^2 + 1)\n  Y(s) = s/(s^2 + 1)^2\n  y(t) = t*sin(t)/2    for t >= 0\n  poles of Y: +-i (double)\n  check: residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 8.3e-16; initial values hold (max difference 0)\n  check: a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 2.3e-13\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "y' + y = heaviside(t-1), y(0) = 0\n  transformed: (s + 1)Y(s) = e^(-s)/s\n  Y(s) = e^(-s)/(s*(s + 1))\n  y(t) = (1 - e^(1 - t))*u(t - 1)    for t >= 0\n  poles of Y: 0, -1\n  check: residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 0; initial values hold (max difference 0)\n  check: a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 3.8e-15\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "laplace_solve", "ucas": "laplace solve y' + y = heaviside(t-1), y(0)=0", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "laplace_solve", "transformed": "(s + 1)Y(s) = e^(-s)/s", "Y(s)": "e^(-s)/(s*(s + 1))", "y(t)": {"value": "(1 - e^(1 - t))*u(t - 1)", "valid_for": "t >= 0"}, "poles_of_y": "0, -1", "headline": "y' + y = heaviside(t-1), y(0) = 0"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 0; initial values hold (max difference 0)"}, {"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 3.8e-15"}], "files": [], "text": "y' + y = heaviside(t-1), y(0) = 0\n  transformed: (s + 1)Y(s) = e^(-s)/s\n  Y(s) = e^(-s)/(s*(s + 1))\n  y(t) = (1 - e^(1 - t))*u(t - 1)    for t >= 0\n  poles of Y: 0, -1\n  check: residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 0; initial values hold (max difference 0)\n  check: a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 3.8e-15\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "x[n+2] = x[n+1] + x[n], x[0] = 0, x[1] = 1\n  transformed: (z^2 - z - 1)Y(z) - (z) = 0\n  Y(z) = z/(z^2 - z - 1)\n  x[n] = sqrt(5)*((1 + sqrt(5))/2)^n/5 - sqrt(5)*((1 - sqrt(5))/2)^n/5    for n >= 0\n  poles of Y: (1 + sqrt(5))/2, (1 - sqrt(5))/2\n  check: iterating the recurrence gives the same x[0..39] (max relative difference 1.2e-15)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "zsolve", "ucas": "zsolve x[n+2] = x[n+1] + x[n], x[0]=0, x[1]=1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "zsolve", "transformed": "(z^2 - z - 1)Y(z) - (z) = 0", "Y(z)": "z/(z^2 - z - 1)", "x[n]": {"value": "sqrt(5)*((1 + sqrt(5))/2)^n/5 - sqrt(5)*((1 - sqrt(5))/2)^n/5", "valid_for": "n >= 0"}, "poles_of_y": "(1 + sqrt(5))/2, (1 - sqrt(5))/2", "headline": "x[n+2] = x[n+1] + x[n], x[0] = 0, x[1] = 1"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "iterating the recurrence gives the same x[0..39] (max relative difference 1.2e-15)"}], "files": [], "text": "x[n+2] = x[n+1] + x[n], x[0] = 0, x[1] = 1\n  transformed: (z^2 - z - 1)Y(z) - (z) = 0\n  Y(z) = z/(z^2 - z - 1)\n  x[n] = sqrt(5)*((1 + sqrt(5))/2)^n/5 - sqrt(5)*((1 - sqrt(5))/2)^n/5    for n >= 0\n  poles of Y: (1 + sqrt(5))/2, (1 - sqrt(5))/2\n  check: iterating the recurrence gives the same x[0..39] (max relative difference 1.2e-15)\n"}, "isError": false}}
